  "title": "Kurkuri Bhindi (Crispy Okra) in the Air Fryer",
  "description": "Okra is coated with flavorful Indian spices and cooked in the air fryer until nice and crispy in this recipe for kurkuri bhindi.",
  "authors": [
    "Hindustanisakhisaheli"
  ],
